# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Webtest Scanner — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values you need.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Stealth Browser: Tier 1 ─ Bright Data Scraping Browser ───────
# Real Chrome + rotating residential proxies + auto-CAPTCHA solving.
# Defeats virtually all bot-detection systems (DataDome, PerimeterX,
# Cloudflare Bot Management, etc.).
#
# How to get this value:
#   1. Sign up at https://brightdata.com
#   2. Go to Proxies & Scraping → Scraping Browser
#   3. Copy the WebSocket endpoint (starts with wss://)
#
# Format: wss://brd-customer-XXXXX:PASSWORD@brd.superproxy.io:9222
#
# Leave blank to fall through to the free stealth options (Tier 2/3).
BRIGHT_DATA_WS_ENDPOINT=

# ── Stealth Browser: Optional proxy for Tier 2/3 runs ────────────
# Not needed when using Bright Data (it provides its own proxies).
# Supports HTTP/HTTPS/SOCKS5 proxy servers.
PROXY_SERVER=
PROXY_USERNAME=
PROXY_PASSWORD=
